<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give it to you straight.</font>

32
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your next mission was commissioned
by a certain feudal lord's daughter.</font>

33
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are to act as her double.</font>

34
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know where she heard about you,</font>

35
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you apparently bear
a striking resemblance to the princess.</font>

36
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:45,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore she requested
that you be the one who carries it out.</font>

37
00:01:45,910 --> 00:01:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A double?</font>

38
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is someone targeting the princess?</font>

39
00:01:51,170 --> 00:01:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, if anything,
she's the one who's doing the targeting.</font>

40
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not to worry.</font>

41
00:01:58,430 --> 00:02:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're already
an admirable Hidden Leaf Shinobi.</font>

42
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, I've arranged
for you to have an assistant.</font>

43
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assistant?</font>

44
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!
You have a mission for me?</font>

45
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And one from a feudal lord to boot!</font>

46
00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Tsunade-sama!</font>

47
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry,
but all the other guys are too busy.</font>

48
00:02:17,570 --> 00:02:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just me and this guy?</font>

49
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. Do your best
to carry out the mission.</font>

50
00:02:29,170 --> 00:02:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The client is
a feudal lord's daughter, huh?</font>

51
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow. I guess that means
that I've finally become good enough</font>

52
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to handle amazing missions
like this, huh?!</font>

53
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't get too excited.</font>

54
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:41,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Terrible things happen
when you're like that.</font>

55
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...
Just leave things in my capable hands!</font>

56
00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a real piece of work.</font>

57
00:02:51,730 --> 00:02:57,690
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ino Screams! Chubby ♥ Paradise</font>

58
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for coming from afar.</font>

59
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the client?</font>

60
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She and Ino really do look alike, but...</font>

61
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a bit of a stretch.</font>

62
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right.
I have an idea of what you wish to say.</font>

63
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My physique doesn't really resemble
that of the double there.</font>

64
00:03:27,010 --> 00:03:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you're thinking, right?</font>

65
00:03:28,980 --> 00:03:32,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh, not at all. Um...
— To be honest,</font>

66
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I don't think you resemble her at all.
— Hey!</font>

67
00:03:34,730 --> 00:03:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I don't blame you for thinking that.
But here, have a look at this!</font>

68
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Ino!</font>

69
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I looked like
a short time ago.</font>

70
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:50,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Truth be told, I only got like this</font>

71
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:53,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after it was decided that I was
to have an arranged courtship.</font>

72
00:03:53,170 --> 00:03:54,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An arranged courtship?!</font>

73
00:03:54,290 --> 00:03:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other party is Master Chikara
from the neighbouring Land of Udon.</font>

74
00:03:57,880 --> 00:04:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since I saw his picture,</font>

75
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my feelings for him have
deepened day by day.</font>

76
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as the day
of the arranged courtship grows closer,</font>

77
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have become increasingly nervous,
my cheeks have been flushed,</font>

78
00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and my heart has been pounding.</font>

79
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't even sleep at night.</font>

80
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And because of that stress,
I've started overeating.</font>

81
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It goes without saying
that you'll get fat if you pig out.</font>

82
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course,
I've taken appropriate countermeasures!</font>

83
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been using something that cuts all
the fats and carbohydrates that I ingest.</font>

84
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"EASY-PEASY SLIM SPECIAL"</b></font>

85
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It didn't work, did it?</font>

86
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I placed too strong hopes in it.</font>

87
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can I possibly have
an arranged courtship</font>

88
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the man I'm infatuated with
when I look like this?</font>

89
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's my situation.
Now, let's get to the main issue.</font>

90
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to attend
the arranged courtship in my place</font>

91
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make it a success at any cost.</font>

92
00:04:56,650 --> 00:05:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! So, this double thing</font>

93
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is just to act on you behalf
at some arranged courtship?!</font>

94
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean
by "some arranged courtship"?!</font>

95
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, when you talk about doubles,
you think of situations</font>

96
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where someone's life is in danger
and that sort of thing.</font>

97
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?!</font>

98
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:15,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The princess's entire life is at stake!
This is major!</font>

99
00:05:15,410 --> 00:05:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! So, you understand a heart in love.</font>

100
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I sure do.
A girl always wants to look cute</font>

101
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the guy she loves.</font>

102
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if she's a fake?</font>

103
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.
I mean, guys prefer slender girls.</font>

104
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's exactly right!</font>

105
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you.</font>

106
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure thing! Leave it to me!</font>

107
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:40,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even if
the arranged courtship goes well,</font>

108
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the gap is just too big.</font>

109
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just have to lose weight
by the day of the wedding.</font>

110
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already have a plan in place for that.</font>

111
00:05:49,820 --> 00:05:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This supplemental type diet food,
"Supplement Slender"!</font>

112
00:05:53,450 --> 00:05:55,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I supplement all three meals
with this...</font>

113
00:05:56,290 --> 00:05:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you draw on the lessons
you're supposed to have learned?</font>

114
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case, I'll use my charms to make
this arranged courtship a success!</font>

115
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This annex is where
I often played in my childhood.</font>

116
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:20,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I plan to use this to listen in on
the arranged courtship from here.</font>

117
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's pretty convenient.</font>

118
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:27,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would love to meet him in person
if I could, but...</font>

119
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:30,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, is he that cool-looking?</font>

120
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course he is!</font>

121
00:06:33,910 --> 00:06:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's someone
with something really special about him!</font>

122
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then, just make sure
he falls for you.</font>

123
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

124
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you weren't motivated.</font>

125
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this is a mission after all.</font>

126
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:51,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I think I'll pull myself together
and hustle!</font>

127
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't do anything unnecessary, okay?</font>

128
00:06:59,770 --> 00:07:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up?</font>

129
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sound is getting closer!</font>

130
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— It's so bright!</font>

131
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are many a handsome man
in this world,</font>

132
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but this man is renowned
even among them!</font>

133
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man makes Land of Udon what it is...</font>

134
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:20,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that sexy man
with glistening sidelong glances!</font>

135
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:24,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The oh-so-great young prince Chikara.</font>

136
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kneel down and bow before him!</font>

137
00:07:32,180 --> 00:07:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

138
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears
that I have kept you waiting, princess.</font>

139
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:38,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... Master Chikara?</font>

140
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's even more intense
than Intense-Brow Sensei.</font>

141
00:07:53,490 --> 00:07:55,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, pretty girl.</font>

142
00:07:56,450 --> 00:07:58,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have constitutional low blood pressure.</font>

143
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:01,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know. He looks more like
he has high blood pressure to me.</font>

144
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:05,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

145
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:08,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you always scatter flower petals?</font>

146
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:10,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flowers are wonderful.</font>

147
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They truly allay the fatigue
of your mind and body.</font>

148
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you find them relaxing?</font>

149
00:08:14,550 --> 00:08:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess.</font>

150
00:08:17,010 --> 00:08:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, then, next.</font>

151
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't you think
he's different from her description?</font>

152
00:08:27,110 --> 00:08:29,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I mean, he's fa...
— Fa...?!</font>

153
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

154
00:08:30,690 --> 00:08:34,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These sweets are really fabulous,
aren't they?</font>

155
00:08:34,860 --> 00:08:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do excuse us.</font>

156
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck are you doing,
out of the blue like that?!</font>

157
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:45,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's women's intuition.</font>

158
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got the same vibe from him as Choji.</font>

159
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That word is probably taboo.</font>

160
00:08:50,590 --> 00:08:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see!</font>

161
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break!</font>

162
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with that uselessly
intense chubby guy showing up</font>

163
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when she told us
he'd be a handsome prince?!</font>

164
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But wouldn't his physique be
a perfect match for her?</font>

165
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:04,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure there must be some mistake.</font>

166
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way a girl would fall in love
with a guy like that.</font>

167
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:09,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But maybe that's
the princess's taste in men.</font>

168
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible. I mean...</font>

169
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's flashy! Intense! And a fatso!</font>

170
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a freak! A freak!</font>

171
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's gotta be a mistake!
I'm sure of it!</font>

172
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think so?</font>

173
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

174
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake that that's
Master Chikara, the man of my heart.</font>

175
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought so.</font>

176
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an elegant man.</font>

177
00:09:35,590 --> 00:09:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I deeply regret that I cannot see him
up close with my very own eyes.</font>

178
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess one could say
that everybody has their own set of woes.</font>

179
00:09:41,850 --> 00:09:45,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, make sure that he takes
a liking to me, no matter what!</font>

180
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop complaining and get the ball rolling
with dogged persistence!</font>

181
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will convey that to her.</font>

182
00:09:56,780 --> 00:10:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has your tension not eased?
Music is good for relaxation.</font>

183
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, you need not go to the trouble.</font>

184
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What did she say?
— She said there's no mistake.</font>

185
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She wants you to bulldoze on ahead!</font>

186
00:10:12,210 --> 00:10:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe it!</font>

187
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's our mission, you know!</font>

188
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that.</font>

189
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:21,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess Fuku, do you like roses?</font>

190
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, very much so.</font>

191
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Great! I love roses, too!</font>

192
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the language of flowers,
they signify love!</font>

193
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:35,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But don't their meanings differ
depending on their color?</font>

194
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example, yellow roses are supposed
to mean "let's break up."</font>

195
00:10:39,070 --> 00:10:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nonsense to discriminate
because of color.</font>

196
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean,
the flowers are not at fault, after all.</font>

197
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For you.</font>

198
00:11:17,990 --> 00:11:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... wait!</font>

199
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

200
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't do it! I can't do it!</font>

201
00:11:26,450 --> 00:11:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way! He's too intense.</font>

202
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way I can act
as a substitute for the princess!</font>

203
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down.
Stop saying that and do your best.</font>

204
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope. I just can't stand him physically.</font>

205
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I got it.</font>

206
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:41,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you just think of him</font>

207
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— as a somewhat intense Choji...
— Choji has fat on him</font>

208
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the sake of his Ninjutsu.</font>

209
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the slightest idea
what purpose that prince's fat serves.</font>

210
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a pretty severe opinion,
you know?</font>

211
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to get away for a moment.</font>

212
00:11:53,310 --> 00:11:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hey, where are you going?</font>

213
00:11:56,570 --> 00:11:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break, that girl's a handful...</font>

214
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this is for the sake
of a mission after all.</font>

215
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it's about time
for Naruto to lend a helping hand!</font>

216
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?!</font>

217
00:12:12,330 --> 00:12:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not judging you, but I think you
should pass on that young prince.</font>

218
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something wrong with his head.
I'm positive!</font>

219
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?
He's a passionate and wonderful man!</font>

220
00:12:25,050 --> 00:12:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

221
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hired the Leaf to provide me
with a substitute</font>

222
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:31,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the arranged courtship
and bring it to success.</font>

223
00:12:31,890 --> 00:12:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a professional Shinobi, right?</font>

224
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I suggest you get on it
and get the job done!</font>

225
00:12:37,770 --> 00:12:41,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The atmosphere in there hasn't been
very congenial at all!</font>

226
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to be aggressive
in making yourself appealing to him!</font>

227
00:12:45,610 --> 00:12:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry
to have kept you waiting, Chikara!</font>

228
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! Just like that... Huh?</font>

229
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That jerk!
— Hey!</font>

230
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess?</font>

231
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Chikara, could you loosen
my sash for me, please?</font>

232
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... But...</font>

233
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please.</font>

234
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:12,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my gosh!</font>

235
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a creepy-crawler up here
under the roof that looks like a sow bug!</font>

236
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:19,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Destruction Jutsu!</font>

237
00:13:21,610 --> 00:13:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A creepy-crawler
that looks like a sow bug?</font>

238
00:13:24,070 --> 00:13:25,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An insect?</font>

239
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, she vanished.</font>

240
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck are you thinking?!</font>

241
00:13:29,950 --> 00:13:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Where is the princess?!
— I don't know!</font>

242
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She vanished.</font>

243
00:13:34,370 --> 00:13:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is going on?</font>

244
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is starting to irritate me.
I can't get what's happening from here.</font>

245
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:44,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you meddling!
I was just one step away!</font>

246
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing,
dressed up like Princess Fuku?!</font>

247
00:13:49,430 --> 00:13:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you!</font>

248
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:52,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In one of Pervy Sage's books
I glanced at,</font>

249
00:13:52,430 --> 00:13:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this is the kind of thing that worked.</font>

250
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't believe that anyone would
use such a garish advance!</font>

251
00:13:59,770 --> 00:14:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's dirty!</font>

252
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's absolutely no way
a type of guy like you</font>

253
00:14:02,650 --> 00:14:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would ever be mistaken
for the protagonist of a shounen manga!</font>

254
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! I was doing a way better job
than you were!</font>

255
00:14:12,410 --> 00:14:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break.</font>

256
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:14,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that things have come to this,</font>

257
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to take care of business
before another meddler gets in the way.</font>

258
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh. You gotta be kidding.</font>

259
00:14:23,210 --> 00:14:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like my help is needed
if this mission is going to succeed.</font>

260
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess, where in the world
have you been?</font>

261
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive me. I was so nervous,
I flew into a panic earlier on.</font>

262
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really seemed like
a totally different person.</font>

263
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so sorry.</font>

264
00:14:43,690 --> 00:14:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were such a wonderful person,
that it became almost unbearable.</font>

265
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:52,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. That is bad.</font>

266
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must change the air in here, then.</font>

267
00:14:54,490 --> 00:14:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, in that case, I will.</font>

268
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:00,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi, Chikara!</font>

269
00:15:09,090 --> 00:15:11,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That just now,
outside the paper door...</font>

270
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:12,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

271
00:15:13,050 --> 00:15:16,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was another princess!</font>

272
00:15:18,270 --> 00:15:20,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That can't be. Impossible.</font>

273
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"INFERNO"</b></font>

274
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

275
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm very moved that
you have such deep feelings for me</font>

276
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you actually saw a vision.</font>

277
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vision? No, I definitely saw...</font>

278
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:32,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mustn't look!</font>

279
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess?</font>

280
00:15:40,910 --> 00:15:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn. I did that without thinking.</font>

281
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, goodness me.</font>

282
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my ardent desire for you
to look just at me, I...</font>

283
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What intense passion.</font>

284
00:15:52,470 --> 00:15:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. As you wish, princess.</font>

285
00:15:56,810 --> 00:16:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Allow me to catch
those hot feelings in fine style.</font>

286
00:16:00,770 --> 00:16:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could this be...?</font>

287
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come, don't hold back.</font>

288
00:16:14,570 --> 00:16:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You may not kiss him! No kisses!</font>

289
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodness, you cannot be
too careful these days!</font>

290
00:16:22,500 --> 00:16:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who told you that you could go
as far as to kiss him?!</font>

291
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's not that I wanted to...</font>

292
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd have to say
that you actually came to my rescue.</font>

293
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't bandy words with me!</font>

294
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully, holding hands is
as much as I can concede to you...!</font>

295
00:16:35,140 --> 00:16:36,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too loud.</font>

296
00:16:36,890 --> 00:16:38,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The princess vanished again.</font>

297
00:16:38,930 --> 00:16:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Princess!
— Princess!</font>

298
00:16:41,230 --> 00:16:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good! I'd better hurry back.</font>

299
00:16:43,100 --> 00:16:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't try anything funny in there!</font>

300
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:51,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that! In any case, we can't let him
see the two of us together!</font>

301
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry back to your room, princess!</font>

302
00:16:54,030 --> 00:16:55,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

303
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break. That Ino...</font>

304
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dumping me in the lake like that.
Thanks to her, I'm freezing!</font>

305
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad! I gotta pee. Gotta go!</font>

306
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know
where the toilet is around here.</font>

307
00:17:16,590 --> 00:17:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody around.
It is an emergency situation after all.</font>

308
00:17:23,100 --> 00:17:24,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

309
00:17:25,060 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck do you think
you're doing over there looking like me?!</font>

310
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, this is... Um...</font>

311
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How shameless!
Stop that immediately!</font>

312
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stop it!</font>

313
00:17:34,190 --> 00:17:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you not understand
that I'm telling you to stop!</font>

314
00:17:36,410 --> 00:17:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible to stop so suddenly!</font>

315
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

316
00:17:47,870 --> 00:17:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait up!</font>

317
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't quite
emotionally prepared earlier on.</font>

318
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, the feelings I have
for you in my heart are true.</font>

319
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess...</font>

320
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Chikara,</font>

321
00:18:04,890 --> 00:18:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have harbored a secret love for you
for a long time.</font>

322
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, take me.</font>

323
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

324
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I wonder what that sound is.
— I have no idea.</font>

325
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rain?</font>

326
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a beautiful rainbow.</font>

327
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, I say!</font>

328
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you, it's impossible!</font>

329
00:18:40,390 --> 00:18:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ouch!
— Princess?!</font>

330
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

331
00:18:47,890 --> 00:18:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

332
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me for this one, please!</font>

333
00:18:51,770 --> 00:18:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't forgive you!</font>

334
00:18:53,230 --> 00:18:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look what you've done!</font>

335
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch! Stop!</font>

336
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is going on?</font>

337
00:18:59,490 --> 00:19:02,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no! Um... This is, well...</font>

338
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, that's enough.
We can't fake it any longer.</font>

339
00:19:07,870 --> 00:19:14,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I apologize for having hoodwinked you.
I am the bona fide Fuku.</font>

340
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean to say that the princess
up to now was an imposter?</font>

341
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is correct.</font>

342
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is the meaning of all this?</font>

343
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:27,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't have imagined
that things would come to such a finale!</font>

344
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not correct, Master Chikara!</font>

345
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of my way!</font>

346
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:37,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The super body I fantasized about
in my dreams! My ideal personified!</font>

347
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bravo!</font>

348
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:52,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My cute princess. Please marry me!</font>

349
00:19:53,290 --> 00:19:55,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm delighted, Master Chikara!</font>

350
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hail the future wife!</font>

351
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this anyway?</font>

352
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somehow it seems like our mission
turned out to be success in the end.</font>

353
00:20:07,850 --> 00:20:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think?</font>

354
00:20:09,470 --> 00:20:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be? I put all my efforts
in making advances on a guy</font>

355
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's not my type in the least
and got rejected.</font>

356
00:20:16,690 --> 00:20:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover,
it was a completely wasted effort.</font>

357
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what happened?</font>

358
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But everything turned out well.
So, isn't it okay?</font>

359
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And both of them looked so happy together.</font>

360
00:20:31,410 --> 00:20:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not the problem!
A damsel's heart has been wounded.</font>

361
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe that, of all things,
I was brushed off by a guy like that.</font>

362
00:20:40,050 --> 00:20:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't even glance in your direction
at the end there.</font>

363
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it! Don't remind me.</font>

364
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can never know
what a person likes, can you?</font>

365
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope. There's no way
I'll acknowledge that!</font>

366
00:20:51,730 --> 00:20:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A man's got to like a slender girl better!</font>

367
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to become
even more of a woman,</font>

368
00:20:58,270 --> 00:21:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going on a diet! On a diet!</font>

369
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:02,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! Wait up!</font>

370
00:21:28,740 --> 00:21:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

